  "material": "Notebook mestre",
  "trecho": "seção 12.9 a 12.11 (células 232 a 243)"
 },
 "html": "<h2 id=\"secao-12-9\">12.9 Tamanho de efeito e intervalo de confiança</h2>\n<p>O <strong>p-valor diz se existe diferença</strong>. O <strong>tamanho de efeito diz o quanto ela importa</strong>. Com amostras grandes, diferenças irrelevantes ficam \"significativas\". Com amostras pequenas, diferenças relevantes podem não ficar. <strong>Sempre reporte os dois.</strong></p>\n<div aria-label=\"Sempre reporte os dois.\" class=\"tabela\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Medida</th>\n<th>Uso</th>\n<th>Referência (Cohen)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>d de Cohen</strong> = <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mover><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">¯</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">¯</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math></td>\n<td>diferença entre 2 médias, em desvios padrão</td>\n<td>0,2 pequeno · 0,5 médio · 0,8 grande</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>η² (eta quadrado)</strong> = <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>S</mi><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>S</mi><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math></td>\n<td>proporção da variância explicada pelos grupos (ANOVA)</td>\n<td>0,01 pequeno · 0,06 médio · 0,14 grande</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>r rank-biserial</strong> = <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>U</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math></td>\n<td>efeito do Mann-Whitney (-1 a 1)</td>\n<td>0,1 pequeno · 0,3 médio · 0,5 grande</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>ε² (épsilon quadrado)</strong> = <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math></td>\n<td>efeito do Kruskal-Wallis (análogo ao η²)</td>\n<td>mesmas referências do η²</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Intervalo de confiança (IC 95%)</strong></td>\n<td>faixa plausível para a média (ou diferença) populacional</td>\n<td>se o IC da diferença não contém 0, a diferença é significativa</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\"><span class=\"tk-kw\">def</span> <span class=\"tk-fn\">cohen_d</span>(a, b):</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"2\">    <span class=\"tk-com\"># d de Cohen com desvio padrão combinado (pooled).</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"3\">    a, b = np.<span class=\"tk-fn\">asarray</span>(a), np.<span class=\"tk-fn\">asarray</span>(b)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"4\">    n1, n2 = <span class=\"tk-bi\">len</span>(a), <span class=\"tk-bi\">len</span>(b)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"5\">    s_pooled = np.<span class=\"tk-fn\">sqrt</span>(((n1 - <span class=\"tk-num\">1</span>) * a.<span class=\"tk-fn\">var</span>(ddof=<span class=\"tk-num\">1</span>) + (n2 - <span class=\"tk-num\">1</span>) * b.<span class=\"tk-fn\">var</span>(ddof=<span class=\"tk-num\">1</span>)) / (n1 + n2 - <span class=\"tk-num\">2</span>))</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"6\">    <span class=\"tk-kw\">return</span> (a.<span class=\"tk-fn\">mean</span>() - b.<span class=\"tk-fn\">mean</span>()) / s_pooled</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"7\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"8\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"9\"><span class=\"tk-kw\">def</span> <span class=\"tk-fn\">eta_quadrado</span>(*amostras):</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"10\">    <span class=\"tk-com\"># η² da ANOVA one-way: soma de quadrados entre grupos / soma de quadrados total.</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"11\">    todos = np.<span class=\"tk-fn\">concatenate</span>(amostras)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"12\">    ss_total = ((todos - todos.<span class=\"tk-fn\">mean</span>()) ** <span class=\"tk-num\">2</span>).<span class=\"tk-fn\">sum</span>()</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"13\">    ss_entre = <span class=\"tk-bi\">sum</span>(<span class=\"tk-bi\">len</span>(g) * (np.<span class=\"tk-fn\">mean</span>(g) - todos.<span class=\"tk-fn\">mean</span>()) ** <span class=\"tk-num\">2</span> <span class=\"tk-kw\">for</span> g <span class=\"tk-kw\">in</span> amostras)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"14\">    <span class=\"tk-kw\">return</span> ss_entre / ss_total</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"15\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"16\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"17\"><span class=\"tk-kw\">def</span> <span class=\"tk-fn\">rank_biserial</span>(a, b):</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"18\">    <span class=\"tk-com\"># Tamanho de efeito do Mann-Whitney: proporção de pares favoráveis menos desfavoráveis.</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"19\">    u, _ = stats.<span class=\"tk-fn\">mannwhitneyu</span>(a, b, alternative=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">two-sided</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"20\">    <span class=\"tk-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"tk-num\">1</span> - <span class=\"tk-num\">2</span> * u / (<span class=\"tk-bi\">len</span>(a) * <span class=\"tk-bi\">len</span>(b))</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"21\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"22\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"23\"><span class=\"tk-kw\">def</span> <span class=\"tk-fn\">epsilon_quadrado</span>(*amostras):</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"24\">    <span class=\"tk-com\"># Tamanho de efeito do Kruskal-Wallis.</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"25\">    h, _ = stats.<span class=\"tk-fn\">kruskal</span>(*amostras)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"26\">    <span class=\"tk-kw\">return</span> h / (<span class=\"tk-bi\">sum</span>(<span class=\"tk-bi\">len</span>(g) <span class=\"tk-kw\">for</span> g <span class=\"tk-kw\">in</span> amostras) - <span class=\"tk-num\">1</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"27\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"28\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"29\"><span class=\"tk-kw\">def</span> <span class=\"tk-fn\">ic_media</span>(valores, confianca=<span class=\"tk-num\">0.95</span>):</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"30\">    <span class=\"tk-com\"># Intervalo de confiança da média pela distribuição t.</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"31\">    valores = np.<span class=\"tk-fn\">asarray</span>(valores)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"32\">    <span class=\"tk-kw\">return</span> stats.t.<span class=\"tk-fn\">interval</span>(confianca, df=<span class=\"tk-bi\">len</span>(valores) - <span class=\"tk-num\">1</span>, loc=valores.<span class=\"tk-fn\">mean</span>(), scale=stats.<span class=\"tk-fn\">sem</span>(valores))</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"33\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"34\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"35\"><span class=\"tk-bi\">print</span>(<span class=\"tk-kw\">f</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">d de Cohen (grupo_1 × grupo_2): </span><span class=\"tk-str\">{</span><span class=\"tk-fn\">cohen_d</span>(grupo_1, grupo_2)<span class=\"tk-str\">:</span><span class=\"tk-str\">.2f</span><span class=\"tk-str\">}</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"36\"><span class=\"tk-bi\">print</span>(<span class=\"tk-kw\">f</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">r rank-biserial               : </span><span class=\"tk-str\">{</span><span class=\"tk-fn\">rank_biserial</span>(grupo_1, grupo_2)<span class=\"tk-str\">:</span><span class=\"tk-str\">.2f</span><span class=\"tk-str\">}</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"37\"><span class=\"tk-bi\">print</span>(<span class=\"tk-kw\">f</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">η² (grupos de </span><span class=\"tk-str\">{</span>var_cat<span class=\"tk-str\">}</span><span class=\"tk-str\">)       : </span><span class=\"tk-str\">{</span><span class=\"tk-fn\">eta_quadrado</span>(*grupos.<span class=\"tk-fn\">values</span>())<span class=\"tk-str\">:</span><span class=\"tk-str\">.3f</span><span class=\"tk-str\">}</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"38\"><span class=\"tk-bi\">print</span>(<span class=\"tk-kw\">f</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">ε² (grupos de </span><span class=\"tk-str\">{</span>var_cat<span class=\"tk-str\">}</span><span class=\"tk-str\">)       : </span><span class=\"tk-str\">{</span><span class=\"tk-fn\">epsilon_quadrado</span>(*grupos.<span class=\"tk-fn\">values</span>())<span class=\"tk-str\">:</span><span class=\"tk-str\">.3f</span><span class=\"tk-str\">}</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"39\"><span class=\"tk-kw\">for</span> nome, valores <span class=\"tk-kw\">in</span> grupos.<span class=\"tk-fn\">items</span>():</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"40\">    li, ls = <span class=\"tk-fn\">ic_media</span>(valores)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"41\">    <span class=\"tk-bi\">print</span>(<span class=\"tk-kw\">f</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">IC 95% da média do grupo </span><span class=\"tk-str\">{</span>nome<span class=\"tk-str\">}</span><span class=\"tk-str\">: [</span><span class=\"tk-str\">{</span>li<span class=\"tk-str\">:</span><span class=\"tk-str\">.2f</span><span class=\"tk-str\">}</span><span class=\"tk-str\">, </span><span class=\"tk-str\">{</span>ls<span class=\"tk-str\">:</span><span class=\"tk-str\">.2f</span><span class=\"tk-str\">}</span><span class=\"tk-str\">]</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"saida\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><p class=\"saida__rotulo\">Saída</p><pre class=\"saida__texto\" tabindex=\"0\">d de Cohen (grupo_1 × grupo_2): -0.87\nr rank-biserial               : 0.44\nη² (grupos de coluna_cat)       : 0.103\nε² (grupos de coluna_cat)       : 0.124\nIC 95% da média do grupo A: [7.76, 8.79]\nIC 95% da média do grupo B: [10.51, 12.12]\nIC 95% da média do grupo C: [12.71, 15.14]</pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"secao-12-10\">12.10 Fluxo completo automatizado</h2>\n<p><strong>O que faz:</strong> aplica o roteiro da Seção <a href=\"/inferir/conceitos-e-pressupostos/#secao-12-2\">12.2</a> (pressupostos → escolha do teste → efeito) e devolve um resumo pronto para interpretar.</p>\n<p><strong>Quando usar:</strong> para comparações rápidas e padronizadas. Sempre olhe os gráficos e as tabelas de pressupostos antes de confiar na escolha automática.</p>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\"><span class=\"tk-kw\">def</span> <span class=\"tk-fn\">comparar_grupos</span>(data, var_num, var_cat, grupos_validos=<span class=\"tk-kw\">None</span>, alfa=ALFA):</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"2\">    <span class=\"tk-com\"># Escolhe e aplica o teste adequado para comparar var_num entre os grupos de var_cat.</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"3\">    dados = data.<span class=\"tk-fn\">dropna</span>(subset=[var_num, var_cat])</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"4\">    <span class=\"tk-kw\">if</span> grupos_validos <span class=\"tk-kw\">is</span> <span class=\"tk-kw\">not</span> <span class=\"tk-kw\">None</span>:</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"5\">        dados = dados[dados[var_cat].<span class=\"tk-fn\">isin</span>(grupos_validos)]</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"6\">    amostras = {k: g[var_num].<span class=\"tk-fn\">to_numpy</span>() <span class=\"tk-kw\">for</span> k, g <span class=\"tk-kw\">in</span> dados.<span class=\"tk-fn\">groupby</span>(var_cat, observed=<span class=\"tk-kw\">True</span>)}</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"7\">    vals = <span class=\"tk-bi\">list</span>(amostras.<span class=\"tk-fn\">values</span>())</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"8\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"9\">    p_normal = [stats.<span class=\"tk-fn\">shapiro</span>(v)[<span class=\"tk-num\">1</span>] <span class=\"tk-kw\">for</span> v <span class=\"tk-kw\">in</span> vals]</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"10\">    normalidade = <span class=\"tk-bi\">all</span>(p &gt; alfa <span class=\"tk-kw\">for</span> p <span class=\"tk-kw\">in</span> p_normal) <span class=\"tk-kw\">or</span> <span class=\"tk-bi\">all</span>(</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"11\">        <span class=\"tk-bi\">len</span>(v) &gt;= <span class=\"tk-num\">30</span> <span class=\"tk-kw\">and</span> <span class=\"tk-bi\">abs</span>(stats.<span class=\"tk-fn\">skew</span>(v)) &lt; <span class=\"tk-num\">1</span> <span class=\"tk-kw\">for</span> v <span class=\"tk-kw\">in</span> vals)         <span class=\"tk-com\"># TLC: n grande e baixa assimetria</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"12\">    homogeneidade = stats.<span class=\"tk-fn\">levene</span>(*vals, center=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">median</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)[<span class=\"tk-num\">1</span>] &gt; alfa</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"13\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"14\">    <span class=\"tk-kw\">if</span> <span class=\"tk-bi\">len</span>(vals) == <span class=\"tk-num\">2</span>:</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"15\">        <span class=\"tk-kw\">if</span> normalidade:</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"16\">            teste = <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">t de Student</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span> <span class=\"tk-kw\">if</span> homogeneidade <span class=\"tk-kw\">else</span> <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">t de Welch</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"17\">            estat, p = stats.<span class=\"tk-fn\">ttest_ind</span>(*vals, equal_var=homogeneidade)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"18\">            efeito = (<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">d de Cohen</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-fn\">cohen_d</span>(*vals))</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"19\">        <span class=\"tk-kw\">else</span>:</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"20\">            teste, (estat, p) = <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">Mann-Whitney</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, stats.<span class=\"tk-fn\">mannwhitneyu</span>(*vals, alternative=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">two-sided</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"21\">            efeito = (<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">r rank-biserial</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-fn\">rank_biserial</span>(*vals))</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"22\">    <span class=\"tk-kw\">else</span>:</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"23\">        <span class=\"tk-kw\">if</span> normalidade:</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"24\">            teste = <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">ANOVA</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span> <span class=\"tk-kw\">if</span> homogeneidade <span class=\"tk-kw\">else</span> <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">ANOVA de Welch</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"25\">            estat, p = stats.<span class=\"tk-fn\">f_oneway</span>(*vals, equal_var=homogeneidade)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"26\">            efeito = (<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">η²</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-fn\">eta_quadrado</span>(*vals))</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"27\">        <span class=\"tk-kw\">else</span>:</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"28\">            teste, (estat, p) = <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">Kruskal-Wallis</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, stats.<span class=\"tk-fn\">kruskal</span>(*vals)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"29\">            efeito = (<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">ε²</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-fn\">epsilon_quadrado</span>(*vals))</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"30\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"31\">    <span class=\"tk-kw\">return</span> pd.<span class=\"tk-fn\">Series</span>({</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"32\">        <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">grupos (n)</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: {k: <span class=\"tk-bi\">len</span>(v) <span class=\"tk-kw\">for</span> k, v <span class=\"tk-kw\">in</span> amostras.<span class=\"tk-fn\">items</span>()},</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"33\">        <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">médias</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: {k: <span class=\"tk-bi\">round</span>(<span class=\"tk-bi\">float</span>(np.<span class=\"tk-fn\">mean</span>(v)), <span class=\"tk-num\">2</span>) <span class=\"tk-kw\">for</span> k, v <span class=\"tk-kw\">in</span> amostras.<span class=\"tk-fn\">items</span>()},</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"34\">        <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">medianas</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: {k: <span class=\"tk-bi\">round</span>(<span class=\"tk-bi\">float</span>(np.<span class=\"tk-fn\">median</span>(v)), <span class=\"tk-num\">2</span>) <span class=\"tk-kw\">for</span> k, v <span class=\"tk-kw\">in</span> amostras.<span class=\"tk-fn\">items</span>()},</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"35\">        <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">normalidade ok</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: normalidade,</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"36\">        <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">variâncias homogêneas</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: homogeneidade,</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"37\">        <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">teste</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: teste,</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"38\">        <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">estatística</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: <span class=\"tk-bi\">round</span>(<span class=\"tk-bi\">float</span>(estat), <span class=\"tk-num\">3</span>),</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"39\">        <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">p-valor</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: <span class=\"tk-bi\">float</span>(p),</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"40\">        <span class=\"tk-kw\">f</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">significativo (α=</span><span class=\"tk-str\">{</span>alfa<span class=\"tk-str\">}</span><span class=\"tk-str\">)</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: p &lt; alfa,</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"41\">        <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">medida de efeito</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: efeito[<span class=\"tk-num\">0</span>],</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"42\">        <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">efeito</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: <span class=\"tk-bi\">round</span>(<span class=\"tk-bi\">float</span>(efeito[<span class=\"tk-num\">1</span>]), <span class=\"tk-num\">3</span>),</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"43\">    })</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"44\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"45\"><span class=\"tk-fn\">comparar_grupos</span>(df, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_num</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_cat</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, grupos_validos=[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">A</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">B</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">C</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>])</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"saida\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><p class=\"saida__rotulo\">Saída</p><pre class=\"saida__texto\" tabindex=\"0\">grupos (n)                     {'A': 470, 'B': 276, 'C': 178}\nmédias                    {'A': 8.28, 'B': 11.32, 'C': 13.93}\nmedianas                     {'A': 6.9, 'B': 10.1, 'C': 12.0}\nnormalidade ok                                          False\nvariâncias homogêneas                                   False\nteste                                          Kruskal-Wallis\nestatística                                            114.70\np-valor                                                  0.00\nsignificativo (α=0.05)                                   True\nmedida de efeito                                           ε²\nefeito                                                   0.12\ndtype: object</pre></div>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\"><span class=\"tk-fn\">comparar_grupos</span>(df, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_num_2</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coluna_binaria</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"saida\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><p class=\"saida__rotulo\">Saída</p><pre class=\"saida__texto\" tabindex=\"0\">grupos (n)                     {0: 809, 1: 191}\nmédias                     {0: 86.99, 1: 127.4}\nmedianas                  {0: 84.21, 1: 105.15}\nnormalidade ok                            False\nvariâncias homogêneas                     False\nteste                              Mann-Whitney\nestatística                           43,168.00\np-valor                                    0.00\nsignificativo (α=0.05)                     True\nmedida de efeito                r rank-biserial\nefeito                                     0.44\ndtype: object</pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"secao-12-11\">12.11 <span class=\"marcador marcador--alternativa\" title=\"Outra forma válida de fazer a mesma tarefa\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icone\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6 3v12\"></path><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"6\" r=\"3\"></circle><circle cx=\"6\" cy=\"18\" r=\"3\"></circle><path d=\"M18 9a9 9 0 0 1-9 9\"></path></svg></span> Alternativa:<code>pingouin</code> (tabelas completas em uma linha)</h2>\n<p><strong>Quando usar:</strong> em relatórios. Cada função devolve um DataFrame com a estatística, os graus de liberdade, o p-valor, o tamanho de efeito, o IC 95% e o poder, sem cálculos manuais.</p>\n<div aria-label=\"Quando usar:\" class=\"tabela\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Etapa</th>\n<th>Função</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Normalidade por grupo</td>\n<td><code>pg.normality(data, dv=, group=)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Homogeneidade (Levene)</td>\n<td><code>pg.homoscedasticity(data, dv=, group=)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>t (com Welch automático se variâncias diferentes)</td>\n<td><code>pg.ttest(x, y, correction='auto')</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ANOVA (com η² parcial) / ANOVA de Welch</td>\n<td><code>pg.anova(...)</code> / <code>pg.welch_anova(...)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pós-testes</td>\n<td><code>pg.pairwise_tukey(...)</code> / <code>pg.pairwise_gameshowell(..., effsize='cohen')</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Não paramétricos</td>\n<td><code>pg.mwu(x, y)</code>, <code>pg.kruskal(...)</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\"><span class=\"tk-kw\">import</span> pingouin <span class=\"tk-kw\">as</span> pg</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"2\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"3\">pg.<span class=\"tk-fn\">normality</span>(dados_teste, dv=var_num, group=var_cat)</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"saida\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><p class=\"saida__rotulo\">Saída</p><div aria-label=\"Saída em tabela\" class=\"tabela\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table class=\"tabela-dados\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\"></th>\n<th scope=\"col\">W</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">pval</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">normal</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\">coluna_cat</th>\n<th scope=\"col\"></th>\n<th scope=\"col\"></th>\n<th scope=\"col\"></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">B</th>\n<td class=\"num\">0.88</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0.00</td>\n<td class=\"num\">False</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">A</th>\n<td class=\"num\">0.82</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0.00</td>\n<td class=\"num\">False</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">C</th>\n<td class=\"num\">0.87</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0.00</td>\n<td class=\"num\">False</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\">pg.<span class=\"tk-fn\">homoscedasticity</span>(dados_teste, dv=var_num, group=var_cat)</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"saida\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><p class=\"saida__rotulo\">Saída</p><div aria-label=\"Saída em tabela\" class=\"tabela\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table class=\"tabela-dados\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\"></th>\n<th scope=\"col\">W</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">pval</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">equal_var</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">levene</th>\n<td class=\"num\">12.00</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0.00</td>\n<td class=\"num\">False</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\">pg.<span class=\"tk-fn\">ttest</span>(grupo_1, grupo_2, correction=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">auto</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)     <span class=\"tk-com\"># inclui IC 95% da diferença e d de Cohen</span></span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"saida\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><p class=\"saida__rotulo\">Saída</p><div aria-label=\"Saída em tabela\" class=\"tabela\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table class=\"tabela-dados\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\"></th>\n<th scope=\"col\">T</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">dof</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">alternative</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">p_val</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">CI95</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">cohen_d</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">power</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">BF10</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">T_test</th>\n<td class=\"num\">-6.15</td>\n<td class=\"num\">198.86</td>\n<td>two-sided</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0.00</td>\n<td>[-53.38, -27.46]</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0.87</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1.00</td>\n<td>7.171e+06</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\">pg.<span class=\"tk-fn\">welch_anova</span>(data=dados_teste, dv=var_num, between=var_cat)</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"saida\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><p class=\"saida__rotulo\">Saída</p><div aria-label=\"Saída em tabela\" class=\"tabela\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table class=\"tabela-dados\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\"></th>\n<th scope=\"col\">Source</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">ddof1</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">ddof2</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">F</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">p_unc</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">np2</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">0</th>\n<td>coluna_cat</td>\n<td class=\"num\">2</td>\n<td class=\"num\">395.82</td>\n<td class=\"num\">46.03</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0.00</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0.10</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\">pg.<span class=\"tk-fn\">pairwise_gameshowell</span>(data=dados_teste, dv=var_num, between=var_cat, effsize=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">cohen</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"saida\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><p class=\"saida__rotulo\">Saída</p><div aria-label=\"Saída em tabela\" class=\"tabela\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table class=\"tabela-dados\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\"></th>\n<th scope=\"col\">A</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">B</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">mean_A</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">mean_B</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">diff</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">se</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">T</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">df</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">pval</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">cohen</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">0</th>\n<td>A</td>\n<td>B</td>\n<td class=\"num\">8.28</td>\n<td class=\"num\">11.32</td>\n<td class=\"num\">-3.04</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0.49</td>\n<td class=\"num\">-6.24</td>\n<td class=\"num\">496.44</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0.00</td>\n<td class=\"num\">-0.50</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">1</th>\n<td>A</td>\n<td>C</td>\n<td class=\"num\">8.28</td>\n<td class=\"num\">13.93</td>\n<td class=\"num\">-5.65</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0.67</td>\n<td class=\"num\">-8.45</td>\n<td class=\"num\">243.96</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0.00</td>\n<td class=\"num\">-0.87</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">2</th>\n<td>B</td>\n<td>C</td>\n<td class=\"num\">11.32</td>\n<td class=\"num\">13.93</td>\n<td class=\"num\">-2.61</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0.74</td>\n<td class=\"num\">-3.53</td>\n<td class=\"num\">327.76</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0.00</td>\n<td class=\"num\">-0.35</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div>\n<aside class=\"callout callout--atencao\"><p class=\"callout__titulo callout__titulo--so-icone\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icone\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path 